 > 0","passed":1,"detail":"自由現金流 = $2,034M"},{"id":3,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"資產回報率持續擴張 (ΔROA > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"回報率穩步領先同業基準"},{"id":4,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"應計利潤品質高 (CFO > 淨利潤)","passed":0,"detail":"真實現金流充沛，無虛報帳面獲利"},{"id":5,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"財務槓桿未惡化 (ΔLeverage ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"總負債資產比率 = 51.1%"},{"id":6,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"短期流動性安全 (ΔLiquidity > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"流動比率 = 1.45"},{"id":7,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"股本未遭稀釋 (ΔShares ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"未大幅增發新股割韭菜"},{"id":8,"category":"營運效率","desc":"毛利率擴張 (ΔMargin > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"產品定價權增強，毛利結構健康"},{"id":9,"category":"營運效率","desc":"資產週轉率提升 (ΔTurnover > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"每單位資產產出效益改善"}],"fair_val":85.17,"default_fair_val":85.17,"premium_pct":165.3,"is_undervalued":false,"pe_trailing":43.5,"pe_forward":38.3,"pb_trailing":17.2,"pb_forward":15.5,"div_yield":0.81,"ps_ratio":11,"fcf_to_ev":2.21,"fcf_to_mcap":2.27,"liab_to_assets":51.1,"cash_to_assets":2.3,"current_ratio":1.45,"roe":39.6,"roa":19.3,"moat":{"ticker":"CTAS","period":"2027Q1","m1_brand_pricing":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"Cintas 在工業服裝租賃和清潔服務領域建立了強大的品牌聲譽，客戶高度認可其可靠性和專業性。這種品牌忠誠度轉化為定價權，因為客戶願意為 Cintas 的品質和便利性支付溢價。相較於小型競爭對手，Cintas 的品牌代表著一種穩定性和信任感，這在服務業中尤為重要。其商業模式圍繞著提供一站式解決方案，進一步鞏固了其在客戶心中的價值，使其能夠在不顯著流失客戶的情況下調整價格，體現了其品牌壁壘的堅實性。","comment_en":"Cintas has established a strong brand reputation in industrial uniform rental and cleaning services, with customers highly recognizing its reliability and professionalism. This brand loyalty translates into pricing power, as customers are willing to pay a premium for Cintas' quality and convenience. Compared to smaller competitors, Cintas' brand represents stability and trust, which is particularly important in the service industry. Its business model revolves around providing one-stop solutions, further solidifying its value in the minds of customers, enabling it to adjust prices without significant customer attrition, reflecting the robustness of its brand barrier."},"m2_patents_regulatory":{"score":2,"comment_zh":"Cintas 的業務模式主要依賴於營運效率和客戶關係，而非專利或特許經營權。雖然其在某些清潔技術或服裝設計上可能擁有少量專利，但這些並非其核心競爭優勢或構成顯著的進入壁壘。行業監管對其影響有限，且並未形成獨特的保護。因此，在專利和監管壁壘方面，Cintas 的得分較低，這意味著其競爭優勢更多地來自於卓越的營運和客戶服務，而非受法律保護的獨特性。","comment_en":"Cintas' business model relies primarily on operational efficiency and customer relationships, rather than patents or regulatory licenses. While it may hold a few patents in certain cleaning technologies or garment designs, these do not constitute its core competitive advantage or form significant barriers to entry. Industry regulations have limited impact on its operations, and no unique protection is derived from them. Therefore, Cintas scores low on patent and regulatory barriers, indicating its competitive advantages stem more from superior operations and customer service than from legally protected uniqueness."},"m3_high_switching_costs":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"Cintas 的客戶轉換成本相對較高。一旦客戶與 Cintas 建立了長期的租賃和服務協議，更換供應商將涉及重新採購、培訓員工、調整流程以及潛在的服務中斷。特別是對於需要高度定制化制服和定期清潔服務的企業而言，轉換的複雜性和潛在的營運風險使得客戶傾向於維持現狀。這種對現有合作關係的依賴，為 Cintas 創造了穩定的客戶基礎和可預測的收入流，是其重要的經濟護城河。","comment_en":"Cintas faces relatively high customer switching costs. Once a customer establishes a long-term rental and service agreement with Cintas, changing suppliers would involve re-procurement, employee training, process adjustments, and potential service disruptions. Especially for businesses requiring highly customized uniforms and regular cleaning services, the complexity and potential operational risks of switching make customers inclined to maintain the status quo. This reliance on existing partnerships creates a stable customer base and predictable revenue stream for Cintas, serving as a significant economic moat."},"m4_network_effects":{"score":2,"comment_zh":"Cintas 的核心業務模式，即工業服裝租賃和清潔服務，並不直接受益於傳統意義上的網絡效應。其價值主要體現在單一客戶與公司之間的服務效率和關係上，而非客戶之間因使用服務而產生的協同效應。雖然其龐大的客戶基礎和廣泛的服務網絡可能帶來一些間接的規模優勢，但並未形成隨著用戶增長而指數級增強的網絡效應壁壘。因此，在網絡效應維度上，Cintas 的得分不高。","comment_en":"Cintas' core business model, industrial uniform rental and cleaning services, does not directly benefit from network effects in the traditional sense. Its value is primarily reflected in the service efficiency and relationship between a single customer and the company, rather than synergistic effects arising from customer interactions through service usage. While its large customer base and extensive service network might offer some indirect scale advantages, it does not form a network effect barrier that strengthens exponentially with user growth. Therefore, Cintas scores low on the network effects dimension."},"m5_cost_advantage_scale":{"score":9,"comment_zh":"Cintas 在規模經濟方面具有顯著優勢。其龐大的營運網絡、集中的採購能力以及標準化的服務流程，使其能夠以低於小型競爭對手的成本提供服務。通過規模化運營，Cintas 能夠攤薄固定成本，優化物流配送，並在採購原材料（如布料、清潔化學品）時獲得更優惠的價格。這種成本優勢不僅提升了其利潤率，也使其能夠提供更具競爭力的價格，進一步鞏固其市場領導地位，形成難以被模仿的規模壁壘。","comment_en":"Cintas possesses a significant advantage in economies of scale. Its vast operational network, centralized procurement capabilities, and standardized service processes enable it to provide services at a lower cost than smaller competitors. Through scaled operations, Cintas can spread fixed costs, optimize logistics, and obtain better prices when purchasing raw materials (such as fabrics and cleaning chemicals). This cost advantage not only enhances its profit margins but also allows it to offer more competitive pricing, further solidifying its market leadership and creating a difficult-to-replicate scale barrier."},"m6_unique_geography_assets":{"score":3,"comment_zh":"Cintas 的業務遍及美國和加拿大，擁有廣泛的服務網點，這使其能夠高效地服務全國範圍內的客戶。然而，其地理佈局並非獨一無二或不可複製。雖然其網絡的廣度和效率構成了一定的進入門檻，但其他全國性或區域性競爭對手也能夠建立類似的服務網絡。因此，在獨特的地理資產方面，Cintas 的壁壘相對較弱，其優勢更多體現在營運的精細化管理而非地理位置的稀缺性上。","comment_en":"Cintas operates across the United States and Canada with an extensive network of service locations, enabling it to efficiently serve customers nationwide. However, its geographical footprint is neither unique nor irreplicable. While the breadth and efficiency of its network constitute a certain entry barrier, other national or regional competitors can also establish similar service networks. Therefore, Cintas' barrier in terms of unique geographical assets is relatively weak; its advantage lies more in refined operational management than in the scarcity of its locations."},"m7_operational_efficiency":{"score":9,"comment_zh":"Cintas 在營運效率方面表現卓越，這是其最核心的競爭優勢之一。公司透過精密的物流系統、標準化的服務流程、先進的清潔技術以及對員工的高效培訓，實現了極高的運營效率。這種對細節的關注和持續的流程優化，使得 Cintas 能夠在保證服務品質的同時，有效控制成本，並快速響應客戶需求。這種卓越的營運能力，是其難以被競爭對手複製的強大護城河，也是其長期高 ROE 的關鍵驅動因素。","comment_en":"Cintas demonstrates exceptional operational efficiency, which is one of its most core competitive advantages. The company achieves extremely high operational efficiency through a sophisticated logistics system, standardized service processes, advanced cleaning technologies, and effective employee training. This attention to detail and continuous process optimization allows Cintas to control costs effectively while ensuring service quality and rapidly responding to customer needs. This superior operational capability is a powerful moat that is difficult for competitors to replicate and a key driver of its consistently high ROE."},"m8_capital_allocation":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"Cintas 在資本配置方面展現了長期以來的卓越能力。公司歷史上通過精明的收購擴張業務版圖，同時也注重有機增長。更重要的是，Cintas 持續將自由現金流回饋股東，通過股票回購有效提升股東價值，同時保持穩健的資產負債表。管理層在再投資於業務和回報股東之間取得了良好的平衡，展現了對股東價值的深刻理解和承諾，這符合巴菲特對優秀資本配置者的評價標準。","comment_en":"Cintas has demonstrated a long-standing excellence in capital allocation. The company has historically expanded its business footprint through astute acquisitions while also focusing on organic growth. More importantly, Cintas consistently returns free cash flow to shareholders through effective share repurchases, thereby enhancing shareholder value while maintaining a strong balance sheet. Management strikes a good balance between reinvesting in the business and returning capital to shareholders, showing a deep understanding and commitment to shareholder value, aligning with Buffett's criteria for excellent capital allocators."},"m9_customer_retention":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"Cintas 擁有極高的客戶保留率，這得益於其可靠的服務、優質的客戶關係管理以及客戶轉換的高成本。一旦客戶習慣了 Cintas 的無縫服務體驗和專業支持，他們通常會長期維持合作關係。公司通過持續的服務質量監控和客戶反饋機制，不斷提升客戶滿意度，進一步鞏固了客戶忠誠度。這種穩定的客戶基礎為 Cintas 提供了可預測的收入來源，是其商業模式的堅實支柱。","comment_en":"Cintas boasts extremely high customer retention rates, attributable to its reliable service, quality customer relationship management, and the high costs associated with switching. Once customers become accustomed to Cintas' seamless service experience and professional support, they typically maintain the partnership long-term. The company continuously enhances customer satisfaction through ongoing service quality monitoring and customer feedback mechanisms, further solidifying customer loyalty. This stable customer base provides Cintas with a predictable revenue stream and is a solid pillar of its business model."},"m10_durability":{"score":9,"comment_zh":"Cintas 的業務模式具有高度的持久性。工業服裝租賃和清潔服務是企業運營中不可或缺的一部分，尤其是在醫療、製造和餐飲等行業，對衛生和專業形象有著持續的需求。即使在經濟下行週期，企業對這些基本服務的需求也相對穩定。Cintas 的規模優勢、營運效率和品牌聲譽使其能夠抵禦競爭壓力，並在長時間內保持領先地位。這種業務的基礎性和 Cintas 的競爭優勢的穩固性，共同構成了其強大的持久性壁壘。","comment_en":"Cintas' business model exhibits high durability. Industrial uniform rental and cleaning services are indispensable aspects of business operations, with continuous demand, especially in sectors like healthcare, manufacturing, and hospitality, where hygiene and professional image are critical. Even during economic downturns, the demand for these essential services remains relatively stable. Cintas' scale advantage, operational efficiency, and brand reputation enable it to withstand competitive pressures and maintain a leading position over extended periods. The fundamental nature of this business combined with the robustness of Cintas' competitive advantages collectively form its strong durability barrier."},"overall_moat_verdict_zh":"Cintas 是一家典型的「收費橋」式企業，其核心競爭力體現在卓越的營運效率和規模經濟上。公司通過提供標準化、可靠且成本效益高的工業服裝租賃和清潔服務，構建了難以逾越的規模和成本壁壘。高客戶轉換成本和強大的品牌聲譽進一步鞏固了其市場地位。儘管缺乏專利或網絡效應等壁壘，但其卓越的資本配置能力和持久的業務需求，使其成為一個具有極高經濟護城河的優質企業。","overall_moat_verdict_en":"Cintas operates as a classic 'toll bridge' business, with its core competitive strengths lying in exceptional operational efficiency and economies of scale. The company has built formidable barriers through scale and cost by providing standardized, reliable, and cost-effective industrial uniform rental and cleaning services. High customer switching costs and a strong brand reputation further solidify its market position. Despite the absence of barriers like patents or network effects, its excellent capital allocation capabilities and the enduring demand for its services make it a high-quality enterprise with a very strong economic moat.","evidenceHash":"325735cb299c3aef27cc77fe7782a5a1527821d5d4018303b2141ea101cd4032","assessmentPolicy":"buffett-moat-v3","model":"gemini-2.5-flash-lite","provider":"Vertex AI"},"ratingSources":{"moat":{"reason":null},"fScore":{"score":8,"checkedAt":null},"zScore":{"asOfDate":"2026-05-31","period":"FY 2026","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":"z","zone":"superRobust","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-28T14:40:26.418Z","evidenceHash":"47dfb32b569b98d5a4b7ace45170f72550133538df21ed3f0e2cf96b1b5a3e4e"},"mScore":{"asOfDate":"2026-05-31","period":"FY 2026","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":null,"zone":"clean","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-28T14:40:26.418Z","evidenceHash":"47dfb32b569b98d5a4b7ace45170f72550133538df21ed3f0e2cf96b1b5a3e4e"}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":false},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/CTAS.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/CTAS.png","website":"https://www.cintas.com","ceo":"Todd Schneider","full_time_employees":"48100","description":"Cintas Corporation specializes in supplying professional uniforms and a range of essential business services primarily across the United States, Canada, and Latin America. The company's operations are divided into three main divisions: Uniform Rental and Facility Services, First Aid and Safety Services, and an 'All Other' segment. Within its Uniform Rental and Facility Services division, Cintas offers rental and maintenance for various workwear, including flame-resistant apparel, alongside floor mats, mops, and industrial towels. This segment also manages restroom sanitation solutions, providing both cleaning services and supplies, and directly sells new uniforms. Additionally, its First Aid and Safety Services segment delivers comprehensive first aid programs, safety solutions, and fire suppression products and services. Cintas reaches its diverse clientele, ranging from small service and manufacturing businesses to large corporate entities, through an extensive distribution network, dedicated local delivery routes, and direct representatives. Established in 1968, Cintas Corporation maintains its headquarters in Cincinnati, Ohio.","description_en":"Cintas Corporation specializes in supplying professional uniforms and a range of essential business services primarily across the United States, Canada, and Latin America. The company's operations are divided into three main divisions: Uniform Rental and Facility Services, First Aid and Safety Services, and an 'All Other' segment. Within its Uniform Rental and Facility Services division, Cintas offers rental and maintenance for various workwear, including flame-resistant apparel, alongside floor mats, mops, and industrial towels. This segment also manages restroom sanitation solutions, providing both cleaning services and supplies, and directly sells new uniforms. Additionally, its First Aid and Safety Services segment delivers comprehensive first aid programs, safety solutions, and fire suppression products and services. Cintas reaches its diverse clientele, ranging from small service and manufacturing businesses to large corporate entities, through an extensive distribution network, dedicated local delivery routes, and direct representatives. Established in 1968, Cintas Corporation maintains its headquarters in Cincinnati, Ohio.","description_zh":"Cintas Corporation（美股代碼：CTAS）為 Industrials 領域之重要企業，專注於 Specialty Business Services 業務，具備清晰之商業壁壘與現金流創造能力。","address":"6800 Cintas Boulevard","city":"Cincinnati","state":"OH","zip":"45262-5737","country":"US","phone":"513 459 1200","full_address":"6800 Cintas Boulevard, Cincinnati, OH 45262-5737, US","range_52w":"161.16-226.67","year_high":226.67,"year_low":161.16,"all_time_high":0,"all_time_low":161.16,"inst_ownership_pct":null,"insider_ownership_pct":null,"top_holders":[],"insider_trades":[{"date":"2026-09-17","name":"TYSOE RONALD W","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":101,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-09-17","name":"Coletti Robert E.","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":29,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-09-17","name":"CARNAHAN KAREN L","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":17,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-09-17","name":"Barstad Melanie W.","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":12,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-08-13","name":"Rozakis Jim","title":"officer: President & COO","is_buy":null,"action":"F-InKind","shares":4041,"price":202.71,"total_val":0.82},{"date":"2026-08-12","name":"Schneider Todd M.","title":"director, officer: CEO and Director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":57944,"price":202.71,"total_val":11.75},{"date":"2026-08-12","name":"Schneider Todd M.","title":"director, officer: CEO and Director","is_buy":null,"action":"F-InKind","shares":35599,"price":202.71,"total_val":7.22},{"date":"2026-08-12","name":"FARMER SCOTT D","title":"director, officer: Executive Chairman","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":830,"price":202.71,"total_val":0.17},{"date":"2026-08-12","name":"FARMER SCOTT D","title":"director,